  "notes": {
    "transfer_probe": "TRANSFER PROBE: freeze the unified MTNN's shared embedding, hold out one domain entirely from head training, then fit ONLY a fresh linear head on the held-out domain's target using the frozen embedding as features. The MTNN 'rung' is this frozen-embedding + linear-probe result; the baseline gauntlet runs on the held-out domain's raw features. A win means the shared representation transferred; a loss means it did not. The held-out domain's own leakage-safe split (temporal) is reused unchanged, so transfer is measured on genuinely future rows.",
    "embedding_training": "{\"transfer_forward_return\": {\"trained_on\": [\"hoops\", \"gridiron\", \"realty\", \"pitch\"], \"heads\": [\"gridiron::next_game_fpts\", \"gridiron::next_game_tds\", \"gridiron::next_game_yards\", \"hoops::next_season_ast\", \"hoops::next_season_bpm\", \"hoops::next_season_per\", \"hoops::next_season_pts\", \"hoops::next_season_reb\", \"hoops::next_season_win_shares\", \"pitch::next_window_goal_contribution\", \"pitch::next_window_minutes\", \"realty::above_market_appreciation\", \"realty::next_year_price_change\", \"realty::three_year_price_change\"], \"best_epoch\": 289, \"epochs_run\": 300, \"best_val_loss\": 0.789017, \"params_total\": 7790, \"wall_seconds\": 27.7}, \"transfer_next_season_per\": {\"trained_on\": [\"gridiron\", \"equities\", \"realty\", \"pitch\"], \"heads\": [\"equities::drawdown_exceedance\", \"equities::forward_realized_vol\", \"equities::forward_return\", \"gridiron::next_game_fpts\", \"gridiron::next_game_tds\", \"gridiron::next_game_yards\", \"pitch::next_window_goal_contribution\", \"pitch::next_window_minutes\", \"realty::above_market_appreciation\", \"realty::next_year_price_change\", \"realty::three_year_price_change\"], \"best_epoch\": 170, \"epochs_run\": 210, \"best_val_loss\": 0.968948, \"params_total\": 7691, \"wall_seconds\": 14.5}}",
    "protocol": "MTNN rung = frozen cross-domain embedding (trained without the held-out domain) + linear probe on the held-out harness train side; baselines run on the held-out domain's raw harness features with the owner lane's exact task construction."
  }
